Z||000000||Formula 18||08-17-2000||10:43 PM||||I finally got my car to sound how I want it too. I took a while to get everything cramed in there but I did it. I am running a 10" MTX sub hidden under neither the passanger's side dash, it is it the "stock location". Up front I decided to go with a pair of 4" Audax home audio speaker and a pair of 3 3/4" piezo tweeters. and a 4 by 6 plate in the back. I've made a bunch of home and PA speakers but this was my 1st attempt at car audio and I think it sounds pretty good. Smooth response from about 30 to 25k Hz. I am trying to get some pics and maybe out together a kit to install the sub under the dash to sell if there is anyone instrusted. ||||reg||1
