Z||000002||Seanh||08-18-2000||04:31 PM||||Hey, I already put a new enclosure up there, but I think lots of people would be interested in putting a 10" there, I am currently driving an 8" up there, and a 10" up front that sits in a sealed box and ports in the pass. side floor. It sounds excellent. I also upgraded to 6x9's up front and 4x6 plate in the back. I also got some midbass/midrange sealed enclosures in the kickpanels without any modification. BTW, email me some more about your system, I am in the business of installing steros and stuff and would like to know more about different systems in Fieros. Thanks<P>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Currently upgrading to a NorthStar.||||reg||1
